<%
  /*
   * "Powered & Secured By" — IndusDefender and IndusNetwork.
   *
   * The same two marks, the same label and the same order as the sign-in page
   * at marthoma.online, in this directory's own warm palette rather than that
   * site's navy and gold: the plate is `--paper-warm` over `--line`, the same
   * pairing the rest of the application uses for a panel, so it reads as part
   * of the page instead of a window cut into it.
   *
   * "Protect. Prevent. Prevail." is set in text here. It is baked into the
   * bottom of the supplied artwork in near-white, which was right on a navy
   * panel and would be invisible on this one, so the shield is cropped free of
   * it and the words are typed — which also lets "Prevail." keep its accent,
   * in the palette's own warm brown.
   *
   * The IndusNetwork lock-up is dark on transparent and keeps the light chip
   * it has on the original, in `--paper` with the application's own border.
   */
%>
<div class="indus-badge">
  <span class="plabel">Powered &amp; Secured By</span>

  <div class="logos">
    <span class="owlwrap">
      <span class="owlname">Indus<span class="def">Defender</span></span>
      <img class="owl" src="/images/indus-defender.png"
           alt="IndusDefender" width="145" height="176">
      <span class="owltag">Protect. Prevent. <span class="last">Prevail.</span></span>
    </span>

    <span class="divider"></span>

    <span class="induschip">
      <img class="indus" src="/images/indus-network.png"
           alt="INDUSNETWORK.ORG — Collaboration Creates Success." width="429" height="80">
    </span>
  </div>
</div>
